  "summary": "NBC26 reports that Flock Safety cameras are in use at the Lowe's parking lot on North Washburn Street in Oshkosh and by the UW-Oshkosh Police Department, based on EFF public records requests. Shoppers and a student interviewed offered mixed but mostly accepting reactions about privacy tradeoffs.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "According to public records requests by the Electronic Frontier Foundation, Lowe\u2019s contracts independently with Flock Safety for parking lot cameras.",
      "paragraph_idx": 4
    },
    {
      "quote": "The University of Wisconsin-Oshkosh Police Department also uses two Flock Safety cameras.",
      "paragraph_idx": 9
    }
